    "title": "Crime Stoppers: 3 crimes in the capital area - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Shajaka Shelton ,\n44 minutes ago\nLANSING, Mich. (WLNS) — This week on Crime Stoppers, police need your help tracking down three people wanted for various types of crimes in the capital area, including a theft of more than $2,300 from a Walgreens.\nIf you have information regarding the cases below, call Crime Stoppers of Mid-Michigan at (517) 483-STOP. You can remain anonymous.\nThose who contact Crime Stoppers with information can receive up to a $1,000 award.\nTheft from Dewitt Walgreens (Crime Stoppers of Mid-Michigan) The Dewitt Township Police Department is asking for any help identifying a man who stole more than $2,300 in merchandise from Walgreens. He arrived as a passenger in a gray or green-colored sedan.",
    "summary": "LANSING, Mich. (WLNS) — This week on Crime Stoppers, police need your help tracking down three people wanted for various types of crimes in the capital area, including a theft of more than $2,300 from a Walgreens. If you have information regarding the cases below, call Crime Stoppers of Mid-Michigan at (517) 483-STOP. Those who contact Crime Stoppers with information can receive up to a $1,000 award. Theft from Dewitt Walgreens (Crime Stoppers of Mid-Michigan) The Dewitt Township Police Department is asking for any help identifying a man who stole more than $2,300 in merchandise from Walgreens.",
